codex
The main weakness is in the comparative scoring: the paper applies a stricter test to lost opportunities for children than to lost opportunities for other groups. I’m checking whether the claimed effects on Karang Taruna and cross-dusun participation are supported strongly enough to justify Forum Anak’s highest seriousness score.

