1681:ated and open to manipulation. Through genuine participation in projects, which involve solutions to real problems, young
1682-people develop the skills of critical reﬂection and comparison of perspectives which are essential to the self-determination
1683-of political beliefs. The beneﬁt is two-fold: to the self realization of the child and to the democratization of society.
